We'll likely release the shinyapps package to CRAN in the next few months (actually it will be a new package called rsconnect <https://github.com/rstudio/rsconnect>). Right now we're in a transition period so we're just waiting to make sure things are settled.

Would it be possible update your package description after that happens?

-Andy

