Thanks Andy,

I used

library(doSNOW)

cl <- parallel::makeCluster(detectCores() - 1)
registerDoSNOW(cl)

foreach(i=1:nrow(m), .combine=rbind) %dopar%

  (m[i,] / mean(m[i,]))
stopCluster(cl); rm(cl) ; gc()

and it work fine,

thanks

David

